e-lined street just minutes from Whyte Ave, this spacious 2-bed, 2-bath home offers the perfect blend of style, comfort & privacy. The thoughtful layout places the bedrooms on opposite sides of the suite, making it ideal for roommates, guests or simply enjoying your own space. The bright, open-concept living & kitchen area features modern finishes, stainless steel appliances, engineered hardwood flooring, a corner gas fireplace & wall-mounted A/C. Relax year-round in the enclosed balcony w/sliding windows. The spacious primary bedroom boasts a walk-in closet w/built-in shelving. In-suite laundry & abundant storage, while an assigned covered parking stall w/plug-in and additional storage space are welcome bonuses. Perfectly located for U of A students and professionals, with easy access to transit, downtown, Whyte Ave and an incredible selection of Ritchie’s restaurants, cafes and boutique shops! (id:67522)","facts":[["Price","$248,800"],["Type","Condo"],["Bedrooms","2"],["Bathrooms","2"],["Living area","979 sq ft"],["Lot size","860 sq ft"],["Year built","1993"],["Condo fee","$615 monthly"],["Neighbourhood","Ritchie"],["Town","Edmonton"],["Postal code","T6E6L7"],["MLS® number","E4507938"],["Listed","September 10, 2026"]],"features":[["Appliances","Washer, Refrigerator, Dishwasher, Stove, Dryer, Microwave, Hood Fan, Window Coverings, Fan"],["Heating","Baseboard heaters"],["Cooling","Window air conditioner"],["Fireplace","Corner"],["Parking","Carport"],["Community","Public Swimming Pool"],["Condo fee includes","Common Area Maintenance, Property Management, Caretaker, Heat, Water, Other, See Remarks"]],"rooms":[["Living room","Main level","4.03 m × 3.92 m (13'3\" × 12'10\")"],["Dining room","Main level","3.51 m × 3.98 m (11'6\" × 13'1\")"],["Kitchen","Main level","2.55 m × 3.87 m (8'4\" × 12'8\")"],["Primary Bedroom","Main level","3.39 m × 4.24 m (11'1\" × 13'11\")"],["Bedroom 2","Main level","3.38 m × 2.89 m (11'1\" × 9'6\")"],["Laundry room","Main level","1.58 m × 2.5